 "notes": [
  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting (8)': Endor Operations / Imperial Outpost, Endor, Endor: Bunker, Endor: Landing Platform, Operational As Planned, Death Star II, Moff Jerjerrod, Imperial Arrest Order; these count toward the 60. Operational As Planned is the starting interrupt (it fetches Death Star II, Jerjerrod and an Effect, here Imperial Arrest Order).",
  "The repeated deck name 'DS2Ops' at the top of the card list was a header, not a card, and was dropped.",
  "Posted 'Tatooine Docking Bay' dested the Dark Premiere Tatooine: Docking Bay 94; 'Tatooine' x2, 'Endor' and 'Death Star II' dested the Dark system printings; 'Bossk in Bus' dested Bossk In Hound's Tooth; 'Mara Jade' dested Mara Jade, The Emperor's Hand.",
  "Secret Plans was an Effect in 2001 (not yet a Defensive Shield) and counts in the 60.",
  "The post's 'Change' note (take out Mos Eisley, add Spaceport Docking Bay) is not applied to the list; the list is as posted.",
  "The wiki also has a later deck by the same player, Patrick Mathieson DS2Ops Returns - Tatooine."
 ]
